OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FInitial rain
OL,6,Fwill clear towards midnight, leaving a
OL,7,Fdrier interlude with a few clear
OL,8,Fspells. Further cloud and outbreaks of
OL,9,Frain will then develop early Thursday
OL,10,Fmorning. Winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy first thing with a
OL,13,Ffew spots of rain. Soon becoming dry
OL,14,Fhowever with sunny spells for the
OL,15,Fremainder of the day. Winds light.
OL,16,FRain arriving later in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
